(7654243, 1245983, 19825, '<td valign="top">Looks like this might be St. Joseph''s Lighthouse. I have been hoping to get over to see this when the weather conditions have been right for a nice icing over. We have had a couple interesting ice days on this side of the lake, but I am not sure about near St. Joe.</td>', 'Looks like this might be St. Joseph''s Lighthouse. I have been hoping to get over to see this when the weather conditions have been right for a nice icing over. We have had a couple interesting ice days on this side of the lake, but I am not sure about near St. Joe.', '2020-02-25 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7654244, 1245866, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love it! 10 for creativity, for processing, for composition. Should take blue (darn it! I like it better than mine!)</td>', 'I love it! 10 for creativity, for processing, for composition. Should take blue (darn it! I like it better than mine!)', '2020-02-25 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7654245, 1246008, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a fascinating subject, but I wish it was composed differently. Perhaps portrait orientation zoomed in on the center branch? The two trunks of the tree are too overpowering for the delicate ice. Maybe even cropping out the right hand trunk and making it less symmetrical?</td>', 'It''s a fascinating subject, but I wish it was composed differently. Perhaps portrait orientation zoomed in on the center branch? The two trunks of the tree are too overpowering for the delicate ice. Maybe even cropping out the right hand trunk and making it less symmetrical?', '2020-02-25 17:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7654246, 1245956, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the slight tilt and the harsh shadows detract. Would the lighting have been any better if they had turned the other direction on the swings? It looks like the light is pretty much sideways, but maybe even a few degrees might help?</td>', 'I like the idea, but the slight tilt and the harsh shadows detract. Would the lighting have been any better if they had turned the other direction on the swings? It looks like the light is pretty much sideways, but maybe even a few degrees might help?', '2020-02-25 17:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7654247, 1245897, 103142, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty. But the more I look at it, the more I realize that the tiny particles of really bright white give it a shimmery fairy feeling. Started off as a 6, now thinking an 8.</td>', 'I thought this was pretty. But the more I look at it, the more I realize that the tiny particles of really bright white give it a shimmery fairy feeling. Started off as a 6, now thinking an 8.', '2020-02-25 17:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
